  "content": [
    {
      "text": "你好,我是Emily.",
      "offset": 866,
      "duration": 2000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Today we're going to read a short story about miss Wang.",
      "offset": 3066,
      "duration": 3734,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll read it at a slow speed and after the story",
      "offset": 7066,
      "duration": 3500,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll show you two important grammar points in the story.",
      "offset": 10566,
      "duration": 4600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's get into it.",
      "offset": 15400,
      "duration": 1366,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "王小姐住在上海",
      "offset": 18900,
      "duration": 3266,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她是上海人",
      "offset": 22966,
      "duration": 2434,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她今年24岁",
      "offset": 26500,
      "duration": 3533,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她家里有三口人",
      "offset": 32000,
      "duration": 3333,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "爸爸妈妈和她",
      "offset": 36033,
      "duration": 3533,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她一个人住",
      "offset": 41700,
      "duration": 1900,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她早上开车去公司工作",
      "offset": 45700,
      "duration": 4733,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她很喜欢她的工作",
      "offset": 52400,
      "duration": 3966,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她的同事有美国人",
      "offset": 57666,
      "duration": 3500,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "也有英国人",
      "offset": 61933,
      "duration": 2100,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "下午王小姐和同事去咖啡店",
      "offset": 66500,
      "duration": 6633,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她喜欢喝咖啡",
      "offset": 74133,
      "duration": 3167,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她和同事们在咖啡店里喝咖啡",
      "offset": 78533,
      "duration": 6633,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "吃三明治和水果沙拉",
      "offset": 85800,
      "duration": 5233,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "星期六和星期天",
      "offset": 93600,
      "duration": 3666,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "王小姐不去公司",
      "offset": 98033,
      "duration": 3633,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她去商店买东西",
      "offset": 103466,
      "duration": 3734,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "和朋友看电影",
      "offset": 108766,
      "duration": 3067,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "去书店看书",
      "offset": 113433,
      "duration": 2967,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "在家的时候",
      "offset": 118433,
      "duration": 2033,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她喜欢看电视和看书",
      "offset": 120900,
      "duration": 5766,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "也喜欢在下雨的时候给朋友打电话",
      "offset": 128500,
      "duration": 7766,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "3月4月和5月",
      "offset": 137900,
      "duration": 4200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "上海很漂亮",
      "offset": 142900,
      "duration": 2866,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "6月的时候",
      "offset": 147000,
      "duration": 1833,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "上海每天都下雨",
      "offset": 149400,
      "duration": 3833,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "7月和8月 天气很热",
      "offset": 155300,
      "duration": 5066,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "11月和12月天气很冷",
      "offset": 162166,
      "duration": 6067,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "王小姐家里有猫",
      "offset": 170666,
      "duration": 3567,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "小猫的名字叫小小",
      "offset": 175533,
      "duration": 4033,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "下雨的时候",
      "offset": 181066,
      "duration": 1934,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "小小喜欢在沙发上睡觉",
      "offset": 183566,
      "duration": 5100,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "天气好的时候",
      "offset": 190166,
      "duration": 2600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "小小喜欢在外面玩",
      "offset": 193666,
      "duration": 3867,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "王小姐没有男朋友",
      "offset": 199666,
      "duration": 4134,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她很想有一个男朋友",
      "offset": 204733,
      "duration": 4800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "和他喝咖啡",
      "offset": 211633,
      "duration": 2300,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "看电影",
      "offset": 214600,
      "duration": 1266,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "去商店买东西",
      "offset": 216533,
      "duration": 3067,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她不喜欢一个人的生活",
      "offset": 221566,
      "duration": 5134,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "王小姐很喜欢上海",
      "offset": 228866,
      "duration": 4300,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "喜欢这儿的生活",
      "offset": 233866,
      "duration": 2734,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "喜欢这儿的天气",
      "offset": 237466,
      "duration": 2634,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "她每天都很高兴",
      "offset": 241400,
      "duration": 3966,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you like the story?",
      "offset": 246833,
      "duration": 1433,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "In this story we have two new grammar points.",
      "offset": 248533,
      "duration": 3033,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "First is the loan words.",
      "offset": 251766,
      "duration": 2167,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "咖啡沙拉沙发三明治",
      "offset": 257000,
      "duration": 7466,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "All of these words are loan words from English.",
      "offset": 265000,
      "duration": 2966,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Can you guess what are they?",
      "offset": 268166,
      "duration": 1834,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "咖啡coffee沙拉salad沙发sofa",
      "offset": 271066,
      "duration": 9134,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "三明治sandwich",
      "offset": 280566,
      "duration": 3367,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "And we have more loanwords like",
      "offset": 284133,
      "duration": 2467,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "汉堡hamburger",
      "offset": 287066,
      "duration": 2667,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "巧克力chocolate柠檬lemon可乐Cola",
      "offset": 290333,
      "duration": 8600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow! Is it amazing?",
      "offset": 299500,
      "duration": 2100,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Next. Grammar number two.",
      "offset": 302333,
      "duration": 1667,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Compound words.",
      "offset": 304000,
      "duration": 2400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Chinese,",
      "offset": 309100,
      "duration": 1066,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "we have tons of compound words as well as English. ",
      "offset": 310166,
      "duration": 3367,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, the word store in English.",
      "offset": 313533,
      "duration": 3667,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Like department store,",
      "offset": 317200,
      "duration": 1500,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "shoe store, grocery store.",
      "offset": 318933,
      "duration": 2233,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Chinese we also use the product name and the word",
      "offset": 321500,
      "duration": 4500,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"dian\" to make up different types of stores.",
      "offset": 326166,
      "duration": 2800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"dian \"is short for shangdian.",
      "offset": 329400,
      "duration": 2800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Here are some examples.",
      "offset": 332766,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "fruit store",
      "offset": 335900,
      "duration": 1166,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "水果店",
      "offset": 337566,
      "duration": 1734,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "bookstore",
      "offset": 339900,
      "duration": 1033,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "书店",
      "offset": 341533,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "The store where you eat, ",
      "offset": 343133,
      "duration": 2200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "restaurant, of course.",
      "offset": 345333,
      "duration": 1666,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "饭店",
      "offset": 347566,
      "duration": 1900,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "coffee shop",
      "offset": 349466,
      "duration": 1800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "咖啡店",
      "offset": 351266,
      "duration": 2234,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "milk tea shop",
      "offset": 353500,
      "duration": 2033,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "奶茶店",
      "offset": 355566,
      "duration": 1933,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Chinese,",
      "offset": 358533,
      "duration": 900,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "we like to use several existing words to make up a new word.",
      "offset": 359433,
      "duration": 3800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's very convenient,",
      "offset": 363233,
      "duration": 1400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "just like assembling Legos.",
      "offset": 364666,
      "duration": 2967,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for watching today's video.",
      "offset": 367700,
      "duration": 1733,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is a series of short stories for Chinese",
      "offset": 369700,
      "duration": 2400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "beginners in my channel.",
      "offset": 372100,
      "duration": 1500,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "They will greatly help you to improve your Chinese.",
      "offset": 373666,
      "duration": 3200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "So try to watch them all, ",
      "offset": 376900,
      "duration": 1966,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "and you will make huge progress in Chinese! ",
      "offset": 378866,
      "duration": 3000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "See you next video!",
      "offset": 381866,
      "duration": 1400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye bye!",
      "offset": 383533,
      "duration": 800,
      "lang": "en"
    }
  ]
}